<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>FAQ</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css"
        crossorigin="anonymous" integrity="sha384-T3c6CoIi6uLrA9TneNEoa7RxnatzjcDSCmG1MXxSR1GAsXEV/Dwwykc2MPK8M2HN">
</head>

<body>


            <h1>FAQ</h1>
            <div class="accordion" id="accordionExample  ">
                <div class="accordion-item  ">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                            data-bs-target="#collapseOne" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="collapseOne  ">
                            What types of steel fabrication products do you offer?
                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="collapseOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse hidden" data-bs-parent="#accordionExample">
                        <div class="accordion-body">

                            Provide an overview of the different types of steel fabrication products your company
                            specializes in, such as structural steel, metalwork, custom fabrications, etc.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                            data-bs-target="#collapseTwo" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseTwo">
                            Can you customize products to our specifications?
                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="collapseTwo" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#accordionExample">
                        <div class="accordion-body">
                            Explain your company's customization capabilities and whether you can tailor products to
                            meet specific client needs or project requirements.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="accordion-item  ">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                            data-bs-target="#collapseThree" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseThree  ">
                            Do you offer installation services?
                                                </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="collapseThree" class="accordion-collapse collapse hidden" data-bs-parent="#accordionExample">
                        <div class="accordion-body">

                            Clarify whether your company provides installation services for the products you manufacture, and if so, detail the scope of those services.
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="accordion-item  ">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                            data-bs-target="#collapsefour" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapsefour  ">
                            What is your shipping and delivery process?
                                                </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="collapsefour" class="accordion-collapse collapse hidden" data-bs-parent="#accordionExample">
                        <div class="accordion-body">

                            Provide details on shipping options, delivery times, packaging, and any associated costs or logistics considerations.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="accordion-item  ">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                            data-bs-target="#collapsefive" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapsefive">
                            What payment options do you accept?
                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="collapsefive" class="accordion-collapse collapse hidden" data-bs-parent="#accordionExample">
                        <div class="accordion-body">

                            Provide an overview of the different types of steel fabrication products your company
                            specializes in, such as structural steel, metalwork, custom fabrications, etc.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="accordion-item  ">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                            data-bs-target="#collapsesix" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapsesix  ">
                            How can I contact customer support?                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="collapsesix" class="accordion-collapse collapse hidden" data-bs-parent="#accordionExample">
                        <div class="accordion-body">

                            Provide contact information for customer support, including phone numbers, email addresses, and any other relevant channels for inquiries or assistance.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="accordion-item  ">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                            data-bs-target="#collapseseven" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseseven  ">
                            Do you offer warranties or guarantees on your products?                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="collapseseven" class="accordion-collapse collapse hidden" data-bs-parent="#accordionExample">
                        <div class="accordion-body">

                            Specify any warranties or guarantees offered on your steel fabrication products, including duration and coverage.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
